@startuml Dynamic Asset Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Dynamic Asset System - Architecture Overview

package "Asset Addition & Approval" {
  [GraphQL API] as GraphQL
  [Organization Service] as OrgService
  [Approval Workflow] as Approval
}

package "HSM Layer" {
  [HSM Queue Publisher] as HSMPub
  [HSM] as HSM
}

database "Special Organization\n(ASSET_SUPPORT_V2)" as SpecialOrg {
  frame "AnchorageData" {
    [AssetConfigs[]]
  }
}

package "Asset Registry Service" {
  [Cron Job\n(60s interval)] as Cron
  database "SupportedAsset\nTable" as DB
  [AssetSupport\ngRPC API] as API
}

package "Client Layer" {
  [AssetTypes Client\n(10s refresh)] as Client
  database "In-Memory Cache\nassetTypesMap" as Cache
}

cloud "Consumer Services" as Services

' Flow connections
GraphQL -down-> OrgService: 1. requestAddAssetSupport\nmutation
OrgService -down-> SpecialOrg: 2. Apply change to\nSpecial Org
Approval -down-> HSMPub: 3. Approved operation\nwith endorsements
HSMPub -right-> HSM: 4. Sign organization\nwith new AssetConfigs
HSM -down-> SpecialOrg: 5. Store signed\norganization

Cron -up-> OrgService: 6. GetOrganizationForPurpose\n(every 60s)
OrgService -up-> SpecialOrg: 6a. Retrieve signed org
Cron -down-> DB: 7. Upsert assets\nfrom AssetConfigs

Client -up-> API: 8. ListAssetTypes gRPC\n(every 10s)
API -up-> DB: 8a. Query assets
Client -down-> Cache: 9. Store in memory\n(assetTypeID -> Info)

Services -up-> Client: 10. Get(id) / List()\nfor asset info
Client -up-> Cache: 10a. Load from cache

note right of SpecialOrg
  **Special Organization**
  - Dedicated org for asset configs
  - Purpose: ASSET_SUPPORT_V2
  - Contains AssetConfigs array
  - HSM-signed for authenticity
end note

note right of DB
  **SupportedAsset Table**
  - id (assetTypeID)
  - name
  - abbreviation
  - decimals
  - networkID
  - tokenType
  - onChainIdentifier
  - isXpress
end note

note right of Cache
  **Cache Structure**
  sync.Map[assetTypeID]
  -> RegisteredAsset {
    AssetInfo
    RegistrationSource
  }
end note

@enduml
